  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Mark a machine initialized once an API start pulled its image by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1572\n* Boot pack machines with a 512 MiB packed-layer DAX window by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1506\n* Size the server's checkpoint caches for its disk and drop an extraction's marker before removing it by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1573\n* Bump the workspace to 1.23.6 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1574\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.23.5...v1.23.6",
